# 8. Secure Architecture Reports
# Deny all reports by default to prevent PII/Blueprint leakage
docs/architecture-reports/*.md
docs/architecture-reports/*.pdf
# ALLOW explicitly encrypted/SOPS files
!docs/architecture-reports/*.sops.md
!docs/architecture-reports/.sops.yaml
!docs/architecture-reports/README.md
